OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Finitially with a few drizzly outbreaks
OL,7,Fof rain. Some clear spells developing
OL,8,Fovernight before further cloud and
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain arrive during the
OL,10,Fsecond half of the night. Very windy
OL,11,Falong the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,14,Frain for much of the day, some heavy
OL,15,Fat times. Rain and cloud clearing for
OL,16,Fa time during the evening. Gale force
OL,17,Fwinds along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
