OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fmix of dry spells and stormy
OL,7,Fconditions to end the week. Heavy
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain with gale force
OL,9,Fwinds in places on Friday. Turning
OL,10,Funsettled once more Saturday evening.
